# Triaged, accepted CVEs — reviewed, with justification. Everything else stays gated at CRITICAL.
#
# twig/twig 3.11.3 — vendored by GLPI 10.0.28 via its locked composer dependencies. GLPI pins this
# version; we cannot bump it without forking GLPI's vendor tree (would break the app). Upstream fixes
# land only when GLPI itself upgrades twig. Low exploitability here: these are template-engine issues
# that require the ability to author/inject Twig templates, which in GLPI requires existing
# authenticated admin access (SSO-gated, four-eyes). Re-evaluate on each GLPI version bump.
